    <briefdescription>
<para>RAII wrapper for OpenSSL <ref refid="raii__wrappers_8h_1a11ccc869c9ea1749e6fe88f44826b56a" kindref="member">EVP_MD_CTX</ref>. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Automatically frees the <ref refid="raii__wrappers_8h_1a11ccc869c9ea1749e6fe88f44826b56a" kindref="member">EVP_MD_CTX</ref> on destruction via EVP_MD_CTX_free. Supports move semantics.</para>
<para>Exception-safe: destructor is noexcept.</para>
<para>Example: <programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><ref refid="classthemis_1_1llm_1_1_scoped_e_v_p_context_1a86acd32ace5fa30854bb35c17f2e8d34" kindref="member">ScopedEVPContext</ref><sp/>ctx(EVP_MD_CTX_new());</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">if</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>(!ctx)<sp/>{</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="keywordflow">throw</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>std::runtime_error(</highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;Failed<sp/>to<sp/>create<sp/>context&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/><sp/><sp/>EVP_DigestSignInit(ctx.get(),<sp/>...);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">}<sp/><sp/></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>EVP_MD_CTX_free()<sp/>automatically<sp/>called<sp/>here</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
